#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0106 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "*** TRIPWIRE - the second of the batch's two LOAD-BEARING presence guards. APERIODC (the grouping key) absent. Requirements.Variables.All [APERIOD] names the TARGET, which is present -> rule EXECUTES. Silent solely because var_exists(APERIODC) is false (no not empty(APERIODC) sibling; that is what the 1.1+ sibling PMDA-AD0106B adds). Data would fire under the EC-44 whole-table regroup: APERIOD={1,1,2}, minority row 3. A VIOLATION here is a real engine detection."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col APERIOD type=Num
